e educational environment for all. Come join us to pursue your\ngraduate degree!\nThe University of Memphis is a public university ranked a Tier One research university\nby the Carnegie Classification. It is a catalyst for creativity, progress, innovation,\nand entrepreneurship.\nWe are one of the most diverse universities in the country, home to over 2,000 international\nstudents from over 100 countries. The University of Memphis is committed to your\nsuccess. International student support programs and activities include pre-arrival\norientations, workshops on OPT and CPT, tax workshops, International Night, and American\nThanksgiving Dinner. Our Center for International Student Services (/cies/) provides\nindividualized service to our international students from the moment of admission\nthrough F-1 practical training.\nThe city of Memphis, TN is nestled on the banks of the Mississippi river. Known as\nthe birthplace of blues and rock and roll, Memphis offers graduate students a vibrant\nmusic scene, world class history and art museums, and award-winning cuisine. Our strong\neconomy provides students with employment, internship, and experiential learning opportunities.\n3720 Alumni Ave, Memphis, TN 38152Phone: (901) 678-2000\nResources\nAcademic CalendarsCanvasCampus MapsITS SupportPolice Services\nInfo\nAccreditationAlumniDirectoryEqual OpportunityJobs\nFollow UofM\nFacebookInstagramLinkedInYouTube\nCopyright \u00a9\n2026 The University of Memphis\nPrivacy PolicyImportant NoticeWeb Accessibility Assistance\n\u00a9", "links": [["Skip to Main Content", "https://www.memphis.edu/graduateadmissions/international/#main-content"], ["Skip to Footer", "https://www.memphis.edu/graduateadmissions/international/#mainFooter"], ["", "https://www.memphis.edu/"], ["Apply", "https://www.memphis.edu/admissions/apply/"], ["Visit", "https://www.memphis.edu/admissions/visit/"], ["Events", "https://www.memphis.edu/calendar/"], ["Athletics", "https://gotigersgo.com"], ["News", "https://